# an aspect may have a second process: a private one, called by its own main (D-179, it was an error with D-066)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
primary aspect b24_aspect_second_process is
  process main is
    print "start";
    apply twin();
  return;
end b24_aspect_second_process;
